# git-filter-repo mailmap for the public gateway-oss extraction.
#
# Format (standard gitmailmap(5)):
#   Proper Name <proper@email>     Commit Name <commit@email>
#
# Use this to rewrite internal author/committer identities into public-safe
# forms before pushing to github.com/stackspine/gateway. Add one line per
# contributor whose internal email should be hidden.
#
# Example:
#   Jane Doe <jane@stackspine.com>     Jane Doe <jane@internal.local>
#   StackSpine Bot <bots@stackspine.com>  lovable-agent <agent@lovable.dev>
#
# Leaving this file with only comments is safe — filter-repo will no-op.
